### Test basic print with default text
GET http://localhost:3000/print

### Test print with custom text
GET http://localhost:3000/print?text=Hello from HTTP test!

### Test print with special characters
GET http://localhost:3000/print?text=Special chars: !@#$%^&*()

### Test print with empty text (should use default)
GET http://localhost:3000/print?text=

### Test print with long text
GET http://localhost:3000/print?text=This is a very long text that will test how the printer handles extended content. It should be able to handle multiple lines and proper text wrapping if needed.

### Test print with spaces and URL encoding
GET http://localhost:3000/print?text=Testing spaces and encoding in the text message

### Test print with layout formatting
POST http://localhost:3000/print
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "text": "ร้านกาแฟ Coffee Shop",
    "align": "center",
    "font": "A",
    "bold": true
  },
  {
    "text": "123 ถนนสุขุมวิท กรุงเทพฯ",
