### Test ESC/POS commands directly
POST http://localhost:3000/print
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commands": [
    "\x1B\x45\x01Hello, Goojprt!\x1B\x45\x00\n",
    "\x1B\x2D\x01This is underlined text.\x1B\x2D\x00\n",
    "\x1B\x61\x01Centered Text\n",
    "\x1B\x61\x00Left Aligned Text\n",
    "\x1B\x61\x02Right Aligned Text\n"
  ]
}

